CAMP AFRO FOLI ARTISTS- FLIGHTS ARE BOOKED! …we can't wait to drum and dance with you all!! We are set for a big one this year! New venue, new program, new [Camp Afro Foli artists](/camp-afro-foli-drum-dance-retreat/), new exciting things in store. Planning for camp is always fun and exciting, especially when the artists just make it super awesome by being there. Creating something amazing is so much easier when you have incredible artists to run the show! By now, I'm sure you are aware who's coming and what the general plan is... but something that we are super excited about that we havn't announced is that this year Bassidi will not only be bringing his gorgeous wife but his beautiful little girl, Sitan Kone. Yay! Cuddles must be booked in advance ;) Anyway for now, [keep posted](/camp-afro-foli-drum-dance-retreat/) on our [Facebook page](https://www.facebook.com/events/370285860374095/) and on our blog for plans for the ADVENTURE FRIDAY evening and of course the new program which will be released soon. For now, check out some more of these awesome images taken by Jimmy Halliday at [last years Camp Afro Foli 2018](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NNmTMrm8y5s&feature=youtu.be).

